// Dungeon definition: an ordered list of levels.
//
// Each entry is one of:
//   Procedural(( ... ))  - generated with the classic Rogue algorithm
//   Fixed(( rows: [...] )) - an inline hand-authored map
//   File("name.ron")      - load a level (Procedural or Fixed) from levels/name.ron
//
// To ADD A LEVEL: insert a new entry here (and, for a fixed map, drop a .ron
// file in levels/). `repeat_last: true` means once you pass the last defined
// level the dungeon keeps generating procedural levels forever.
(
    name: "The Dungeons of Doom",
    levels: [
        File("entrance.ron"),
        File("vault.ron"),
        Procedural(()),
        Procedural((depth: Some(5))),
    ],
    repeat_last: true,
)
